{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f46834657722487ab750d10b640417aba14545a4803ef29211c0f52ec8689631", "ja": "（スチームパンク映画の撮影が進んでいる。\nセットのこだわりもすごくて、いい作品になりそうだ）", "zh": "（蒸汽朋克电影的拍摄正在进行中。布景也非常讲究，感觉会拍成一部很棒的作品。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1001_p", "source_sha256": "414a60cf708464102e59e06935feb8faba3a89285543fd214023b58ee562250a", "ja": "おかげで書類の山が。一日整理しても終わらない……。\nあれ？　なんか美味しそうな匂いが。", "zh": "多亏了这个，文件堆成山了。整理一天也整理不完……  \n咦？好像闻到了什么香味。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "a2d4d95ec27fbd7fce27fbba74cbb8d87e544f5c2d9a01e2d119472bdaa4349d", "ja": "わっほーい！　{$P$}さんに、\n『特製肉まん機械都市セット』のお届けで～す。", "zh": "哇——呼！给{$P$}先生送\n“特制肉包机械都市套餐”来啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5679c99c4575ecbb4e0b2f0a61ba0ae5aa835b64cf53a0cebc51d70e2e076f6e", "ja": "おお。匂いの正体はそれか。\n肉まんと……ポテトと唐揚げ？", "zh": "哦，原来香味的真面目是这个啊。肉包，还有……薯条和炸鸡？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "9a313af4293b97a7a428dd9c8cc79bc44cf055fc3eca1189de0bed8fbbf3720a", "ja": "はい。フィッシュアンドチップス……の予定だったん\nですけど、カロリーが足りなかったので唐揚げです♪", "zh": "是的。本来……是炸鱼薯条的，不过热量不够，所以换成炸鸡啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1ca1316cf829ca79de7afaf9b2ed30cd3e19ea9f71f19d0c9ba8d83a8039fe16", "ja": "……つまり、チキンアンドチップスか。\nでも、なんでまた？", "zh": "……也就是说，是炸鸡配薯条啊。不过，怎么又是这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "80eb5ff77681abbb0b6521668711886d6b6e1481b6f2a17ba8f62f1b8dc3c765", "ja": "現場の差し入れに、いつもフィッシュアンドチップスが\nあるんです。", "zh": "片场慰问品里，总是有炸鱼薯条。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "83f856c3fc4e10658da6779fbfa121843e4d34de488fff25ddd31c976f26ebff", "ja": "なんでも、スチームパンクのベースになった時代に、\n労働者の間で広まった料理らしいですよ。", "zh": "听说这道菜是在成为蒸汽朋克基础的那个时代，于工人之间流传开来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "1c1160124f83455431d0e89a4916c7a5b7b3e1b4dbd7abf820e47c4193e6ce8b", "ja": "私が演じた王子様も、もしかしたら食べてたのかも？\nなんて想像していたら……作っちゃってました。", "zh": "我扮演的王子，说不定也吃过呢？\n就这么想着想着……不知不觉就做出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b2c2eec7af1b02adc432bf9b0e96c7a23c4dbf101baa971fef4aee9778effb46", "ja": "そうだな。気さくな人物みたいだし、\nふらっと広場に来ては、食べてたかもな。", "zh": "是啊。毕竟他看起来是个平易近人的人，说不定会偶尔来到广场，吃上一点呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "e28f20984277e1071e3b03744863f0d0561b64a5d81e7499b03f41f91fd5c026", "ja": "はい。屋台で買って、子ども達と一緒に食べたり……。\n人と仲良くなる近道に、料理は欠かせませんからね。", "zh": "是的。会在摊位上买些吃的，和孩子们一起吃……  \n料理可是与人拉近关系的必不可少的捷径呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "f51b4af2d2ec83f4aa5023b8536778ee84e0a2d5f72a7a1db8223bdc8bbd758d", "ja": "私達ももっと仲良くなったら、撮影も捗るかも！\nというわけで、{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "要是我们也能变得更亲近，拍摄说不定也会更顺利！所以，{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c51bbc243fc8f0d21acfad2cf07beb2e962024b4d1d8e00782b41957e4c9decd", "ja": "ははっ。なんとなくわかったよ。\nこの肉まんセットを差し入れしたいんだろ？", "zh": "哈哈，我大概明白了。你是想把这份肉包套餐送给大家当慰问品吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "104db5b67188cd8abbc338faf17015a7b3d8554427a6366141b22e851e0d2331", "ja": "さすが、お見通しですね♪　私、スタッフのみなさん\nにも、おなか一杯になってもらいたいんです。", "zh": "不愧是你，一眼就看穿了呢♪我也想让工作人员们吃得饱饱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "e3869ef1b83843077828bd0794652c99823815d93cc6c492ecfab4512c4cb8e5", "ja": "仲良くしたいのもそうですけど。スタッフさんの力が\nあっての撮影ですから！　お礼の気持ちも届けたくて。", "zh": "虽然是想和大家好好相处啦。不过，这次拍摄也离不开工作人员的力量！我也想把感谢之情传达给他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1015_p", "source_sha256": "00a586afa1551d93b565a4337663a2116c64a6d87bb4c476e3c5f1b0df103754", "ja": "そうだな。美奈子と同じで、スタッフさん達も\n頑張ってるんだし。きっと喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。美奈子说得没错，工作人员们也一直在努力。大家一定会很开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0ff86c3b9b8ecb94f14e1b68949f8c2558e3f5778b921cfe36bf6ab3431c9607", "ja": "じゃあ、俺の方で人数を確認しておこうかな。\nでも……結構な量になると思うけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "那人数就由我来确认一下吧。不过……数量可能会相当多，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0583_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "17c4755edfc1801bc6d843e2edb92a92f6899d6122456dae62c40fd4ac4a4a3e", "ja": "任せてください！　お店のピークタイムで鍛えられて\nますから。演技と同じくらい頑張りますね♪", "zh": "交给我吧！我可是经过店里高峰时段锻炼的。这次也会像演戏一样努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
